# Copy to .env (gitignored — never commit real credentials) in this same directory. Read fresh
# per call by EnvConfig, keyed to this tool's own name ('bitbucket-open-pr') — not shared with
# any other tool's .env.

# Basic-auth credentials for the Bitbucket Cloud REST API: an Atlassian account email plus an API
# token generated at id.atlassian.com (Security -> API tokens). Bitbucket App Passwords were
# retired for creation on 2025-09-09 and fully disabled on 2026-06-09, so this is the only
# supported method now. Which env var pair belongs to which authProfile is declared in
# auth-profiles.json — add a new pair here and a matching entry there for another Bitbucket
# account/profile, rather than reusing this one.
OPEN_PULL_REQUEST_BITBUCKET_EMAIL="@rarolabs.com.br"
OPEN_PULL_REQUEST_BITBUCKET_API_TOKEN="uahseae"
